{"about_the_game":"<strong>The Last Cargo</strong> is a atmospheric top-down survival horror that invoking the need of deeper reflection. The action takes place in a mysterious building with specific features, where many objects of your surroundings are randomized during each play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/2fb1e6cf4d59d0a2e07557953422cf87.webp?t=1760118566\" width=615 height=32 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/df7b55f0cb83d728c848dad5b46bd928.poster.avif?t=1760118566\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/df7b55f0cb83d728c848dad5b46bd928.webm?t=1760118566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/df7b55f0cb83d728c848dad5b46bd928.mp4?t=1760118566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The situation of our character is unique. His beliefs, imposed onto him, have limited his movement in the form of a <strong>wheelchair</strong>. To survive you must explore floor after floor looking for food, ammunition and many other helpful items.<br><br>The main theme of <strong>The Last Cargo</strong> is indoctrination, whose purpose is to control the way an individual perceives and evaluates reality. Your goal is to recover autonomy and subjectivity for the eponymous cargo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/2fb1e6cf4d59d0a2e07557953422cf87.webp?t=1760118566\" width=615 height=32 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every game is different due to unique randomizing system<br></li><li> Consequences and Variables mechanics influencing many additional factors in the game<br></li><li> 18 perks (<i>adaptations</i>) each with 3 stages of development<br></li><li> 6 different endings dependent on the player's choices<br></li><li> 3 difficulty levels and optional permadeath mode<br></li><li> It's not an easy game (<i>draw conclusions and learn from mistakes</i>)</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/593560?t=1760118566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760118566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/b0b66720af9632efd5c0b4f837e4c96a51b52411/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760118566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/b0b66720af9632efd5c0b4f837e4c96a51b52411/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760118566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2254240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>OUR NEXT GAMES:</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>The Last Cargo</strong> is a atmospheric top-down survival horror that invoking the need of deeper reflection. The action takes place in a mysterious building with specific features, where many objects of your surroundings are randomized during each play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/2fb1e6cf4d59d0a2e07557953422cf87.webp?t=1760118566\" width=615 height=32 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/df7b55f0cb83d728c848dad5b46bd928.poster.avif?t=1760118566\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/df7b55f0cb83d728c848dad5b46bd928.webm?t=1760118566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/df7b55f0cb83d728c848dad5b46bd928.mp4?t=1760118566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The situation of our character is unique. His beliefs, imposed onto him, have limited his movement in the form of a <strong>wheelchair</strong>. To survive you must explore floor after floor looking for food, ammunition and many other helpful items.<br><br>The main theme of <strong>The Last Cargo</strong> is indoctrination, whose purpose is to control the way an individual perceives and evaluates reality. Your goal is to recover autonomy and subjectivity for the eponymous cargo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/extras/2fb1e6cf4d59d0a2e07557953422cf87.webp?t=1760118566\" width=615 height=32 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every game is different due to unique randomizing system<br></li><li> Consequences and Variables mechanics influencing many additional factors in the game<br></li><li> 18 perks (<i>adaptations</i>) each with 3 stages of development<br></li><li> 6 different endings dependent on the player's choices<br></li><li> 3 difficulty levels and optional permadeath mode<br></li><li> It's not an easy game (<i>draw conclusions and learn from mistakes</i>)</li></ul>","developers":["Ehnenu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593560/4d479c57315ab5a59bea45d05a858a5fd1